# Generated (graphify knowledge graph): regenerable via `graphify update .`.
# Kept out of this public repo; regenerate locally as needed.
# No trailing slash on purpose — `graphify-out/` would match only a directory and
# leave a symlinked graphify-out tracked; the bare name matches both.
graphify-out
